        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, chikasa chaYehova hichinehihi mwaka chikaŋa anyi kwamwinaku; hela matu indi hiya nalemendendi mwaka akaŋa anyi kutiyaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi wupaji wudi kwakulehi nanetu, nikuloŋa hikwakatuwanaku. Twatalilaŋa chejeji, hikudi mwidima. Twatalilaŋa kutooka, ilaŋa yetu tukwenda mukabwidibwidi awa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twapaŋatilaŋa mbaŋu neyi mputamesu; mwalala twapapataŋa neyi antu akadi mesu. Twadimbukaŋa itaŋwa mwiwulu neyi kwiji hakajimbawenyi. Twekala mwiyila bwi-i neyi afu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wejima wetu twabulumaŋa neyi abera, twadilaŋa neyi tumbolu. Twatalilaŋa wuŋaji, aka, kwosi. Twatalilaŋa wamwinu, aka, wudi kwakulehinanetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyiloŋa yetu yavula dehi kumesu eyi, ninshidi jetu hijikutushimuna wunsahu wakututanyisha. Muloŋa nyiloŋa yetu yidi nanetu, nikuluwaluwa kwetu tunakwiluki; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chitwaputolaŋa nakudikala Yehova, chitwabalumukaŋa nakuleka kulonda Nzambi yetu, hitukuhoshahosha jakukabisha akwetu nŋakudikaŋa, munyichima yetu hitukufuukula nikuhoshamazu akutwamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuŋa aji wafutalelaku dehi, nikuloŋa nemani dehi kwakulehi; muloŋa nsaŋu yalala yadimbuka dehi hanzi, kulumbuluka kunakaŋanyi kwiŋila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eŋa, nsaŋu yalala kwosi; nimuntu wukufuma kuyatama wudi neyi naditwali kudi chisuma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wachimweni, chimwabulili wuŋaji chamutiyishili kutama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
